        "id": "image_prompt_template",
        "type": "nodetool.text.Prompt",
        "data": {
          "prompt": "Behind-the-scenes photograph of a practical effects studio, shot from a DIAGONAL SIDE ANGLE.\n\nCAMERA POSITION: The photographer is standing at the RIGHT SIDE of a massive indoor water tank, shooting DIAGONALLY across toward the far end.\n\nRIGHT SIDE OF FRAME (foreground):\nProfessional film crew - 3-4 people wearing black 'EFFECTS CREW' t-shirts. They are positioned along the near edge of the tank, operating cinema cameras on dolly tracks. One camera on a tall jib/crane arm. Monitors and equipment visible.\n\nLEFT SIDE - THE WATER TANK:\nA long rectangular water tank. The water is COMPLETELY CALM and still. Bright blue chroma key screen covers the entire far wall with orange/red tracking markers.\n\nFAR END OF TANK - LARGE MINIATURE (important!):\nA MASSIVE detailed miniature scale model of {{ city }} SPANS THE ENTIRE WIDTH of the tank at the far end. The miniature is LARGE and impressive - detailed skyscrapers with lit windows, a pier with ferris wheel, palm trees, colorful Art Deco buildings, a beach with sand. The miniature city stretches from left edge to right edge of the tank. It fills the background.\n\nBRIGHT studio lighting from overhead film lights. The perspective creates depth - we look down the length of the tank toward the impressive miniature city.\n\nPhotorealistic behind-the-scenes documentary photograph. Diagonal composition."
        },
        "ui_properties": {
          "position": { "x": 350, "y": 10 },
          "width": 440,
          "height": 460,
