          "prompt": "Animate this side-angle studio photograph. The camera will PAN and FOLLOW the action.\n\nPHASE 1 (0-2 sec): Calm anticipation. Slight camera movement. Crew ready.\n\nPHASE 2 (2-5 sec): A {{ disaster }} suddenly forms on the RIGHT side of the tank (near the camera). The wave begins traveling LEFT across the tank toward the miniature {{ city }}. Camera starts PANNING LEFT to follow the wave.\n\nPHASE 3 (5-10 sec): The wave grows massive as it travels. Camera continues tracking LEFT, following the wave. The wave CRASHES into the miniature city on the left. Spectacular destruction - buildings fall, water explodes, debris flies. Slow-motion feel.\n\nPHASE 4 (10-15 sec): Aftermath. Camera completes the pan, now looking at the destroyed flooded miniature. Crew reacts with excitement. Water continues flooding.\n\nKey: Camera MOVES from right to left, following the wave across the entire tank. Bright studio lighting throughout. 15 seconds total."
